* Structure of this course
- Recap (from November: quiz of the last student presentation as warm-up)
- Lecture with student discussions
- From November: student presentation (30 minutes + questions)
- Exercises (+ homework)

: Pause in der Mitte?

* Exercises and AI

- The exercises are not graded. They are for *you*.
- If an AI solves them, you haven't learned anything, you only lost the time.
- First try it yourself. Then ask a coding agent and compare: What did it do differently? Is it correct?
- In your presentation and in the questions afterwards, only your own understanding counts.

: Ehrlich ansprechen, nicht als Verbot: Ich kontrolliere das nicht und will es auch nicht. Aber wer die Übungen von der KI lösen lässt, betrügt nur sich selbst.

